OL,3,GNEWSAFlower deliveries cut as firms
OL,4,Abattle fuel costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix months after the start of the
OL,7,FUS-Iran conflict, businesses say they
OL,8,Fare battling to keep rising fuel costs
OL,9,Ffrom their customers.
OL,11,FStephen Wharram Florists, in Hessle,
OL,12,Fsaid it had stopped delivering to
OL,13,Fcertain areas and had been forced to
OL,14,Fincrease its delivery charge due to
OL,15,Fprolonged high fuel prices.
OL,17,FSally Wharram said filling the van to
OL,18,Fdeliver the flowers now costs #125
OL,19,Fevery two weeks, compared with about
OL,20,F#90 previously.
